{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MolecularConstruction.H2sAngleS3BraidHolonomy","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MolecularConstruction.H2sAngleS3BraidHolonomy","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.opening_eq_holonomy_of_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.opening_eq_holonomy_of_conj","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2s-angle-s3-braid-holonomy.lean#L37-L42","doc":"If the conjecture holds for `d`, the opening is exactly the holonomy phase\n(this much is unconditional given the class instance). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2SAngleS3HolonomyConjecture.angle_eq_holonomy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2SAngleS3HolonomyConjecture.angle_eq_holonomy","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2s-angle-s3-braid-holonomy.lean#L35-L35","doc":"The substantive claim: opening `=` chiral `S³` braid-holonomy phase. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2SAngleS3HolonomyConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2SAngleS3HolonomyConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2s-angle-s3-braid-holonomy.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2SAngleS3HolonomyConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2SAngleS3HolonomyConjecture","kind":"class","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2s-angle-s3-braid-holonomy.lean#L29-L35","doc":"**Conjecture** (`sorry`-free as a class; the *instance* carries the\nconjectural content, §3b): the H₂S bond-angle opening equals the chiral `S³`\nbraid holonomy. Providing an instance amounts to proving the identification —\nthat is the open conjecture. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:h2s-angle-s3-braid-holonomy","label":"conj:h2s-angle-s3-braid-holonomy","md":"quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2s-angle-s3-braid-holonomy.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2SChiralData.s3BraidHolonomyDeg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2SChiralData.s3BraidHolonomyDeg","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2s-angle-s3-braid-holonomy.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Chiral `S³` braid-holonomy phase on the `(2,1)` chirality cell (degrees). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2SChiralData.angleOpeningDeg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2SChiralData.angleOpeningDeg","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2s-angle-s3-braid-holonomy.lean#L25-L25","doc":"Observed/predicted H–S–H angle minus the pure-`p` base `90°` (degrees). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2SChiralData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2SChiralData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2s-angle-s3-braid-holonomy.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.H2SChiralData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.H2SChiralData","kind":"structure","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2s-angle-s3-braid-holonomy.lean#L20-L27","doc":"The two real quantities the conjecture equates (both in degrees): the H₂S\nH–S–H opening above the pure-`p` base, and the chiral `S³` braid-holonomy phase\n(monodromy around `ζ_ℓ`) of the `3p_z` lone on the `c_λ=0` `(2,1)` cell. ","signatureChunk":0}]}